       range  specified  by  FFIIRRSSTT__GGIIDD and LLAASSTT__GGIIDD in the configuration file.
       The range may be overridden with the ----ffiirrssttggiidd and ----llaassttggiidd  options.
       Finally, the GID can be set fully manually with the ----ggiidd option.

